      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "events_ingest (Null engine) hashes ids\nvia an MV into events_v2 (MergeTree:\nsite, day, type, event, session). Six\nMVs keep aggregates up to date at\ninsert time: site_daily, session_day,\ndim_daily, filter_daily, event_daily,\nweb_vitals. 24-month TTL drops whole\nparts.",
