      "updated": 1794210710273,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Quota reclaim every 5 min. Usage metering every 15 min\n(ClickHouse to Postgres). Retention daily. Reconciliation 04:20\nUTC: aggregates vs raw, alert above 0.5% pageviews / 2% uniques.\nDuplicate-rate check, target <= 0.01%.",
      "originalText": "Quota reclaim every 5 min. Usage metering every 15 min\n(ClickHouse to Postgres). Retention daily. Reconciliation 04:20\nUTC: aggregates vs raw, alert above 0.5% pageviews / 2% uniques.\nDuplicate-rate check, target <= 0.01%.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
